TEXT 0 2016 Left 2 ;A3_base_with_dem_chopped, testbench A_chop
TEXT 0 2056 Left 2 ;Nets are joined by their labels (same name = same net). Open in LTspice and press Run.
TEXT 0 2096 Left 2 ;Chopped (DEM) transient, 500 kHz clock: the averaged output current is the result; plot -I(Vo).
TEXT 0 2136 Left 2 !.include ptm90.lib
TEXT 0 2176 Left 2 !.tran 0 20u 0 5n uic
TEXT 0 2216 Left 2 !.meas TRAN iout_avg AVG -I(Vo) FROM=8u TO=20u
TEXT 0 2256 Left 2 !.meas TRAN err_avg_pct PARAM 100*(iout_avg-10u)/10u
TEXT 0 2296 Left 2 !.meas TRAN vin_avg AVG V(inn) FROM=8u TO=20u
